{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/\u82f1\u6587\u52a0\u613f\u671b\u5355.gif?t=1743072861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a journey to Doloc Town, a post-apocalyptic oasis filled with abandoned ruins, quirky architectures, and folks of all kinds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/Visual.gif?t=1743072861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Revitalizing this empty land and get to know the townies around. Thrive and discover your destiny as you explore deeper into this unknown territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/1222.png?t=1743072861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/Farming.gif?t=1743072861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather resources to get your farm started. As a farmer, you're tasked with planting, watering, harvesting, and even shielding crops from adverse weather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct buildings, upgrade facilities, and craft advanced tools to turn your little corner into a farming paradise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/1223.png?t=1743072861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/Explore.gif?t=1743072861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore this unknown territory, with intricate valley, treacherous wetland, and abandoned ruins awaits. Scout the vast, untouched wilderness in search for secret relics. treasures and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the center of the map lies Doloc Town, a post-apocalyptic sanctuary built from the debris of trains and bridge structures. Get to know the townsfolk and connect with them for much-needed resources. Have a drink with villagers to discover their stories and unfold the hidden secrets of this land. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Above all, the key is to endure the wasteland and pursue whatever your heart truly desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/1221.png?t=1743072861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/Weather.gif?t=1743072861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive\u00a0the\u00a0harsh\u00a0elements\u00a0of\u00a0this\u00a0postapocalyptic\u00a0world,\u00a0from\u00a0scorching\u00a0heatwaves\u00a0to\u00a0deadly acid\u00a0rains\u00a0and\u00a0more!\u00a0Protect\u00a0your\u00a0crops\u00a0and\u00a0adapt\u00a0to\u00a0unpredictable\u00a0conditions\u00a0to\u00a0keep\u00a0your farmland\u00a0thriving.\u00a0Will\u00a0you\u00a0endure\u00a0nature's\u00a0fury,\u00a0or\u00a0will\u00a0it\u00a0overwhelm\u00a0you?\u00a0The\u00a0choice\u00a0is\u00a0yours.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2285550?t=1743072861","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743072861","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/8fa1daf0b1a49adc325751f3926ee0363c32e439/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743072861","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/8fa1daf0b1a49adc325751f3926ee0363c32e439/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743072861","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3243760,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Join Our Community!</h1><p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/\u591a\u6d1b\u53efdiscord\u56fe600x125.png?t=1743072861\" /></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/\u82f1\u6587\u52a0\u613f\u671b\u5355.gif?t=1743072861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a journey to Doloc Town, a post-apocalyptic oasis filled with abandoned ruins, quirky architectures, and folks of all kinds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/Visual.gif?t=1743072861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Revitalizing this empty land and get to know the townies around. Thrive and discover your destiny as you explore deeper into this unknown territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/1222.png?t=1743072861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/Farming.gif?t=1743072861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather resources to get your farm started. As a farmer, you're tasked with planting, watering, harvesting, and even shielding crops from adverse weather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct buildings, upgrade facilities, and craft advanced tools to turn your little corner into a farming paradise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/1223.png?t=1743072861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/Explore.gif?t=1743072861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore this unknown territory, with intricate valley, treacherous wetland, and abandoned ruins awaits. Scout the vast, untouched wilderness in search for secret relics. treasures and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the center of the map lies Doloc Town, a post-apocalyptic sanctuary built from the debris of trains and bridge structures. Get to know the townsfolk and connect with them for much-needed resources. Have a drink with villagers to discover their stories and unfold the hidden secrets of this land. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Above all, the key is to endure the wasteland and pursue whatever your heart truly desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/1221.png?t=1743072861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/extras/Weather.gif?t=1743072861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive\u00a0the\u00a0harsh\u00a0elements\u00a0of\u00a0this\u00a0postapocalyptic\u00a0world,\u00a0from\u00a0scorching\u00a0heatwaves\u00a0to\u00a0deadly acid\u00a0rains\u00a0and\u00a0more!\u00a0Protect\u00a0your\u00a0crops\u00a0and\u00a0adapt\u00a0to\u00a0unpredictable\u00a0conditions\u00a0to\u00a0keep\u00a0your farmland\u00a0thriving.\u00a0Will\u00a0you\u00a0endure\u00a0nature's\u00a0fury,\u00a0or\u00a0will\u00a0it\u00a0overwhelm\u00a0you?\u00a0The\u00a0choice\u00a0is\u00a0yours.</p>","developers":["RedSaw Games Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285550/bee3b9a6ba5f3d7cb78209351484e1acd1f90a61/